      <description>[lʹidʹʒu̜] Quotation: Cha chluinn mi [lʹidʹʒu̜] Gàidhlig. Notes: I don’t hear a word of Gaelic.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp117240192">treabh-eòrna</headword>
      <description>[t̪ɾɑvjɔʴṉ] Quotation: Na rinn thu [n̪t̪ɾɑvjɔʴṉ] agad fhathast? Notes: Have you sown your barley yet? [NOTES: the turned r used for the symbol which is unclear in the original.]</description>
    </item>
    <item>
